{
 "_comment": [
  "Static operator id (volan, a city-index operator id, mav) -> its GTFS-Realtime feeds.",
  "Generated from public-transport/transitous feeds/hu.json and the Volan agency ids; see docs/realtime.md.",
  "match: trip = the card's static trip_id (index trip element 6) is the feed's trip_id without prefix;",
  "route_start = route_id (without prefix) and the HHMMSS start in the trip_id; train = the train number from the source's static GTFS (trip_short_name).",
  "mavplusz: true = ask mavplusz.hu (M\u00c1V's OpenTripPlanner) first for the trips a card names by trip_id, these feeds only when it fails; remove the key to read only these feeds (docs/realtime.md)."
 ],
